Package: oofold
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign fixed-width line folder and terminal wrapping utility in pure openOODA.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 POSIX CLI flags, and streaming Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
